   "description": "Project Silverfish VR by Blind. A / B / X / Y = interact, reload, fire mode, jump. D-pad = flashlight, inventory, previous / next weapon. Triggers = fire and aim. Right bumper = pick up (hold = lower the weapon), left bumper = weapon light / laser, pry, harvest. Grips = two-handed hold, crouch-jump (with Y), utility slots (left grip, squeezed fully, + D-pad). Left stick click = sprint, right stick click = crouch, Menu = pause, View = journal. The full list is in the mod's README and on its settings page in UEVR's menu.",
